#: {{syn|la|trux|ferōx|violēns|immānis|efferus|ferus|crūdēlis|barbaricus|silvāticus|ācer|sevērus|acerbus}}
#: {{ant|la|misericors|mītis|tranquillus|placidus|quietus|clemens}}
# [[heinous]], [[cruel]], [[severe]]
# [[terrible]], [[frightening]], [[dreadful]]

